<title>AUSTRALIA: AUSTRALIAN STOCKS TO WATCH TODAY - AUG 14.</title>
<headline>AUSTRALIAN STOCKS TO WATCH TODAY - AUG 14.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>*Colonial Ltd A$3.40 (-.03)</p>
<p>Recently listed bancassurance group posts half year maiden net profit of A$57 million.</p>
<p>*Sydney Harbour Casino A$1.95 (-.10)</p>
<p>Sydney casino operator reports half year net loss A$7.34 million.</p>
<p>*Commonwealth Bank A$16.28 (-.09)</p>
<p>On Wednesday bank reported eight percent higher net profit after tax but before abnormals of A$1.206 billion, just above a median forecast by analysts of A$1.189 billion.</p>
<p>*WMC A$7.41 (-.01)</p>
<p>Major miner on Wednesday reported pre-abnormals net profit of A$228.2 million for the 12 months to June 30, at the upper end of anlysts' range of A$195 million to A$240 million.</p>
<p>*Lend Lease A$</p>
<p>Financial services, developer and information technology conglomerate due to report full year results.</p>
<p>*Leighton Holdings A$5.78 (-.22)</p>
<p>Developer and contract miner due to report full year results.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
